            "title": "Heating Technology",
            "text": "<p>The<strong> Legacy PRO 2</strong> and <strong>Legacy CORE</strong> both use <strong>hybrid heating</strong>, combining convection and conduction for more even vaporization and smoother flavor.</p><p>This gives you faster sessions, more efficient material use, and better overall temperature performance. It is one of the biggest reasons these devices feel more premium than entry-level options.</p>",
            "tag_1": "Hybrid Heating",
            "tag_2": "Convection",
            "tag_3": "Conduction",
            "tag_4": "",
            "tag_5": ""
          }
        },
