            "title": "Advanced Control vs Essential Experience",
            "text": "<p>The <strong>Legacy PRO 2</strong> is built for users who want maximum control and more premium features. It offers precise temperature adjustment, a full display for key settings, <strong>On-Demand Mode</strong>, and <strong>wireless charging</strong>.</p><p>The <strong>Legacy CORE</strong> is for users who want a more straightforward premium experience. It focuses on the essentials with <strong>7 preset temperature settings</strong> and <strong>USB-C charging</strong>, while also standing out through <strong>vibrant color options</strong> and <strong>interchangeable face skins</strong> for a more personal look.</p>",
            "tag_1": "On-Demand Mode",
            "tag_2": "7 Presets",
            "tag_3": "Face Skins",
            "tag_4": "",
            "tag_5": ""
          }
        },
