            "title": "Battery + Charging",
            "text": "<p>Battery life plays a huge role in everyday use. The <strong>Legacy PRO 2 </strong>and <strong>Legacy CORE </strong>both offer strong battery performance for dependable, longer sessions.<br/><br/>The <strong>PRO 2 </strong>goes further with <strong>wireless charging </strong>for added convenience, while the <strong>CORE </strong>keeps things simple and efficient with <strong>USB-C charging</strong>. Both are designed to support regular use without feeling limited.<br/><br/></p>",
            "tag_1": "Wireless Charging",
            "tag_2": "USB-C",
            "tag_3": "Long Sessions",
            "tag_4": "",
            "tag_5": ""
          }
        },
