            "title": "Airpath + Materials",
            "text": "<p>Premium materials make a real difference in how a vaporizer performs.<br/><br/>The <strong>Legacy PRO 2 </strong>and <strong>Legacy CORE </strong>feature an <strong>isolated airpath </strong>with stainless steel and glass to help keep vapor cleaner and cooler. Their <strong>gold-plated heating chambers </strong>support more consistent heat transfer and better flavor integrity without exposed electronics in the vapor path.<br/><br/></p>",
            "tag_1": "Isolated Airpath",
            "tag_2": "Stainless & Glass",
            "tag_3": "Gold-Plated Chamber",
            "tag_4": "",
            "tag_5": ""
