            "title": "Portability + Use",
            "text": "<p>The <strong>PRO 2 </strong>and <strong>CORE </strong>strike a strong balance between performance and portability. They are compact enough to travel comfortably, but powerful enough to deliver full sessions at home.<br/><br/>If your top priority is minimal size above everything else, the <strong>XS GO </strong>or <strong>OM Keychain Waxpen </strong>may be a better fit. If you want a more complete premium experience, the <strong>Legacy line </strong>makes more sense.<br/><br/></p>",
