            "title": "Cleaning + Maintenance",
            "text": "<p>A device should not feel annoying to own after the first week. That is where design really matters.</p><p>The <strong>Legacy PRO 2</strong> and <strong>Legacy CORE</strong> are built for easier long-term upkeep, with features like a <strong>magnetic chamber lid</strong>, <strong>removable mouthpiece</strong>, and accessible isolated parts that make cleaning simpler and more straightforward.</p>",
            "tag_1": "Magnetic Lid",
            "tag_2": "Removable Mouthpiece",
            "tag_3": "Easy Cleaning",
            "tag_4": "",
            "tag_5": ""
          }
        }
      },
