        },
        "text_3dBtq6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The <strong>Legacy PRO 2</strong> was designed for users who want more control, cleaner flavor, and premium materials without giving up portability.</p><p>Every detail serves a purpose, from the <strong>gold-plated chamber</strong> for heat precision to the <strong>isolated airpath</strong> for cleaner vapor and <strong>wireless charging</strong> for everyday convenience. It is not just a device upgrade. It is a better session from start to finish.</p>"
          }
        },
