        "text_RxxArJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The <strong>Legacy CORE</strong> was designed for users who value simplicity, reliability, and personal style without sacrificing performance.</p><p>It delivers the essential features that matter most, with carefully tuned preset temperatures for consistent sessions and durable materials built for everyday use. <strong>USB-C charging</strong> keeps it simple and efficient, while bold colors and interchangeable face skins let you make it your own.</p><p>It is not about adding more just to look fancy. It is about refining what matters and letting your device reflect your style.</p>"
